SUMMARY:[Healthcare & Clinical AI][Biomedical Imaging] AIiH 2027 - Special 
 session proposals
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: International Conference on AI in Healthcare\
 nWebsite: https://aiih.cc/\nSource URL: https://aiih.cc/important-dates/\
 nLocation: Oxford\, United Kingdom\nTopics: Healthcare & Clinical AI\, Bi
 omedical Imaging\, Machine Learning\, Signal Processing\nSize: M\nSubmiss
 ion type: Full papers (double-blind\, proceedings) or abstracts (posters/
 spotlights\, Zenodo)\; late-breaking abstracts and STARS surveys\nConfide
 nce: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-29\nNotes: Official AIiH pages
  (checked 2026-10-29) list the fourth edition at the Mathematical Institu
 te\, University of Oxford\, Sep 1-3\, 2027\; the format is not stated. De
 adlines are published as 11.59PM Pacific Time (GMT-8)\; the January propo
 sal row keeps -08:00\, while rows falling in PDT (Apr 9\, Jun 11\, Jul 2)
  store the earlier GMT-7 instant per their cutoff notes\, and the date-on
 ly notification keeps -08:00. Full papers are double-blind via CMT (2026 
 papers appeared in Springer LNCS)\; abstracts and STARS surveys are archi
 ved on Zenodo. Size is an editorial estimate.\nScope: Artificial intellig
 ence for healthcare and medicine\, including predictive analytics\, early
  diagnosis and prevention\, machine and deep learning on health data\, AI
 -aided medical signal processing and imaging\, digital pathology and neur
 ology\, drug discovery\, digital twins and precision medicine. Ethics\, p
 atient data privacy and patient-centred deployment are recurring themes. 
 Original research papers\, abstracts and state-of-the-art surveys are acc
 epted.\nAdditional topics: Ethics & Governance\, Privacy-preserving ML\, 
 Human-AI Interaction & Deployment\nScope sources (2027): https://aiih.cc/
 call-for-papers/\, https://aiih.cc/call-for-stars/\nScope last checked: 2
 026-10-29
URL:https://aiih.cc/important-dates/
